This question evaluates practical expertise in implementing granular cost governance mechanisms within a multi-tenant SaaS architecture using AWS managed services. It demonstrates the ability to design scalable, automated controls that maintain service quality while enforcing financial boundaries across tenant workloads.

## Key Concepts
- API Gateway usage plans with per-tenant quotas and throttling
- Lambda reserved concurrency for tenant-specific resource isolation
- CloudWatch custom metrics and alarm-based monitoring
- EventBridge rule-based event routing and notifications
- Step Functions workflow orchestration for automated remediation
- Comprehensive onboarding processes, testing strategies, and rollback procedures

